    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "30 Millstream is a beautifully presented one-bedroom, first-floor apartment ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Links development directly opposite Portmarnock DART Station. The property enjoys excellent natural light throughout and benefits from a superb south-west facing balcony, providing an ideal outdoor space to relax, unwind and soak in the sunshine.\r\n\r\nBright and well-proportioned throughout, this attractive apartment will appeal to first-time buyers and downsizers alike. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with generous storage, a spacious double bedroom with an excellent range of fitted wardrobes, large bathroom, well-appointed kitchen and a bright and spacious open-plan lounge/dining area with access to a sunny southwest facing balcony.\r\n\r\nThe Links is a secure gated development set amidst mature, landscaped grounds with underground parking and a peaceful, family-friendly atmosphere. The development also benefits from an onsite creche while Portmarnock DART Station is directly opposite, providing convenient access to Malahide Village and Dublin City Centre. The nearby Velvet Strand, coastal walks and an excellent range of local amenities further enhance the appeal of this superb location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\t3.06 x 1.51   Decorative timber floor, large hot press, storage closet security phone\r\n\r\nKitchen\t3.15 x 1.89\tTiled floor, tiled splashback, fitted units, dishwasher, washing machine, fridge / freezer, hob, extractor fan,\r\n\r\nLounge/Diner\t5.98 x 3.54\tDecorative timber floor, 2 x light fittings, shelving, storage closet, doors to sunny southwest facing balcony\r\n\r\nBalcony\t\t   outdoor living space, sunny southwest facing aspect\r\n\r\nBathroom\t1.74 x 2.14\tTiled floor & partial walls, w.c, w.h.b, bath suite with shower screen, mirror, fan, shaving light, handheld shower head\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\t4.82 x 2.91\tDecorative timber floor, light fitting, abundance of fitted wardrobes,"
      },
      {
